  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EDGAR RANCH CONSERVATION EASEMENT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will protect shortgrass prairie grassland in southeastern Colorado through the acquisition of a permanent conservation easement on 10,985 acres. The easement will be used as a demonstration project to provide outreach and education to at least five additional neighboring landowners. The easement holder will conduct annual monitoring activities in perpetuity.</narrative>
  </description>
